  'p_set_reference_lines_indoors_and_outdoors_with_the_bosch_professional_gcl2_50_g_p_ul_li_4_self_levelling_with_alarm_keeps_lines_true_within_0_3_mm_m_li_li_projects_up_to35_m_with_flexible_cross_line_with_plumb_points_modes_li_li_runs_on12v_li_ion_pack_for_up_to8_h_continuous_operation_li_ul' => '<p>Set reference lines indoors and outdoors with the Bosch Professional GCL 2-50 G.</p><ul><li>±4° self-levelling with alarm keeps lines true within ±0.3 mm/m.</li><li>Projects up to 35 m with flexible cross-line with plumb points modes.</li><li>Runs on 12V Li-ion pack for up to 8 h continuous operation.</li></ul>',
  'p_set_reference_lines_indoors_and_outdoors_with_the_bosch_professional_gll3_80_c_p_ul_li_4_auto_levelling_keeps_lines_true_within_0_2_mm_m_li_li_projects_up_to30_m_with_flexible3_x360_planes_modes_li_li_runs_on12v_li_ion_or_aa_adapter_for_up_to6_h_continuous_operation_li_ul' => '<p>Set reference lines indoors and outdoors with the Bosch Professional GLL 3-80 C.</p><ul><li>±4° auto levelling keeps lines true within ±0.2 mm/m.</li><li>Projects up to 30 m with flexible 3 x 360° planes modes.</li><li>Runs on 12V Li-ion or AA adapter for up to 6 h continuous operation.</li></ul>',
  'p_set_reference_lines_indoors_and_outdoors_with_the_bosch_professional_gtl3_p_ul_li_4_levelling_with_tilt_function_keeps_lines_true_within_0_4_mm_m_li_li_projects_up_to20_m_with_flexible_tile_layout_cross_45_modes_li_li_runs_on_aa_batteries_for_up_to12_h_continuous_operation_li_ul' => '<p>Set reference lines indoors and outdoors with the Bosch Professional GTL 3.</p><ul><li>±4° levelling with tilt function keeps lines true within ±0.4 mm/m.</li><li>Projects up to 20 m with flexible tile layout cross + 45° modes.</li><li>Runs on AA batteries for up to 12 h continuous operation.</li></ul>',
  'p_set_reference_lines_indoors_and_outdoors_with_the_dewalt_dce088d1r_p_ul_li_4_self_levelling_keeps_lines_true_within_0_3_mm_m_li_li_projects_up_to50_m_with_detector_with_flexible_horizontal_and_vertical_red_lines_modes_li_li_runs_on12v_xr_li_ion_for_up_to8_h_continuous_operation_li_ul' => '<p>Set reference lines indoors and outdoors with the DeWalt DCE088D1R.</p><ul><li>±4° self levelling keeps lines true within ±0.3 mm/m.</li><li>Projects up to 50 m with detector with flexible horizontal and vertical red lines modes.</li><li>Runs on 12V XR Li-ion for up to 8 h continuous operation.</li></ul>',
  'p_set_reference_lines_indoors_and_outdoors_with_the_dewalt_dce089d1g_p_ul_li_4_auto_levelling_keeps_lines_true_within_0_2_mm_m_li_li_projects_up_to30_m_with_flexible3_x360_green_beams_modes_li_li_runs_on12v_xr_li_ion_for_up_to10_h_continuous_operation_li_ul' => '<p>Set reference lines indoors and outdoors with the DeWalt DCE089D1G.</p><ul><li>±4° auto levelling keeps lines true within ±0.2 mm/m.</li><li>Projects up to 30 m with flexible 3 x 360° green beams modes.</li><li>Runs on 12V XR Li-ion for up to 10 h continuous operation.</li></ul>',
  'p_set_reference_lines_indoors_and_outdoors_with_the_dewalt_dw088cg_p_ul_li_4_levelling_keeps_lines_true_within_0_3_mm_m_li_li_projects_up_to30_m_with_flexible_cross_line_green_modes_li_li_runs_on_aa_batteries_for_up_to12_h_continuous_operation_li_ul' => '<p>Set reference lines indoors and outdoors with the DeWalt DW088CG.</p><ul><li>±4° levelling keeps lines true within ±0.3 mm/m.</li><li>Projects up to 30 m with flexible cross-line green modes.</li><li>Runs on AA batteries for up to 12 h continuous operation.</li></ul>',
  'p_set_reference_lines_indoors_and_outdoors_with_the_hilti_pm20_cg_p_ul_li_4_auto_levelling_with_lock_keeps_lines_true_within_0_3_mm_m_li_li_projects_up_to35_m_with_flexible_cross_line_green_modes_li_li_runs_on22v_nuron_li_ion_for_up_to8_h_continuous_operation_li_ul' => '<p>Set reference lines indoors and outdoors with the Hilti PM 20-CG.</p><ul><li>±4° auto levelling with lock keeps lines true within ±0.3 mm/m.</li><li>Projects up to 35 m with flexible cross-line green modes.</li><li>Runs on 22V Nuron Li-ion for up to 8 h continuous operation.</li></ul>',
