  'p_snap_fit_modules_shield_gutters_from_debris_while_allowing_optimal_water_flow_p_p_compatible_with_standard_residential_gutter_profiles_p' => '<p>Snap-fit modules shield gutters from debris while allowing optimal water flow.</p><p>Compatible with standard residential gutter profiles.</p>',
  'p_stainless_steel_blades_and_ergonomic_grips_speed_up_taping_and_mud_work_p_p_includes_corner_applicator_and_adjustable_sanding_pole_p' => '<p>Stainless steel blades and ergonomic grips speed up taping and mud work.</p><p>Includes corner applicator and adjustable sanding pole.</p>',
  'p_the3m6502ql_defends_against_dust_and_aerosols_p_ul_li_p3_r_bayonet_filters_provide_certified_filtration_performance_li_li_3m_cool_flow_valve_reduces_breathing_resistance_li_li_quick_latch_head_harness_maintain_a_reliable_seal_for_active_crews_li_ul' => '<p>The 3M 6502QL defends against dust and aerosols.</p><ul><li>P3 R bayonet filters provide certified filtration performance.</li><li>3M Cool Flow valve reduces breathing resistance.</li><li>Quick Latch head harness maintain a reliable seal for active crews.</li></ul>',
  'p_the3m7502_defends_against_dust_and_aerosols_p_ul_li_bayonet_p2_p3_cartridges_provide_certified_filtration_performance_li_li_low_resistance_exhalation_valve_reduces_breathing_resistance_li_li_soft_silicone_twin_strap_maintain_a_reliable_seal_for_active_crews_li_ul' => '<p>The 3M 7502 defends against dust and aerosols.</p><ul><li>bayonet P2/P3 cartridges provide certified filtration performance.</li><li>low-resistance exhalation valve reduces breathing resistance.</li><li>soft silicone twin strap maintain a reliable seal for active crews.</li></ul>',
  'p_the3m_ff_803x4_defends_against_dust_and_aerosols_p_ul_li_ff_400_series_cartridges_provide_certified_filtration_performance_li_li_cool_flow_exhalation_valve_reduces_breathing_resistance_li_li_silicone_head_cradle_maintain_a_reliable_seal_for_active_crews_li_ul' => '<p>The 3M FF-803X4 defends against dust and aerosols.</p><ul><li>FF-400 series cartridges provide certified filtration performance.</li><li>Cool Flow exhalation valve reduces breathing resistance.</li><li>silicone head cradle maintain a reliable seal for active crews.</li></ul>',
  'p_the_bosch_professional_gbh18v_26_profactor_rotary_hammer_is_built_for_crews_that_need_consistent_impact_power_p_ul_li_2_6_j_impact_energy_with0_4600_bpm_blows_per_minute_li_li_balanced_housing_weighing_only3_3_kg_to_reduce_fatigue_li_li_runs_on_the18v_procore_ecosystem_so_batteries_swap_across_the_fleet_li_ul' => '<p>The Bosch Professional GBH18V-26 PROFACTOR rotary hammer is built for crews that need consistent impact power.</p><ul><li>2.6 J impact energy with 0-4600 bpm blows per minute.</li><li>Balanced housing weighing only 3.3 kg to reduce fatigue.</li><li>Runs on the 18V ProCORE ecosystem so batteries swap across the fleet.</li></ul>',
  'p_the_bosch_professional_gbh18v_28_profactor_rotary_hammer_is_built_for_crews_that_need_consistent_impact_power_p_ul_li_2_8_j_impact_energy_with0_4600_bpm_blows_per_minute_li_li_balanced_housing_weighing_only3_5_kg_to_reduce_fatigue_li_li_runs_on_the18v_procore_ecosystem_so_batteries_swap_across_the_fleet_li_ul' => '<p>The Bosch Professional GBH18V-28 PROFACTOR rotary hammer is built for crews that need consistent impact power.</p><ul><li>2.8 J impact energy with 0-4600 bpm blows per minute.</li><li>Balanced housing weighing only 3.5 kg to reduce fatigue.</li><li>Runs on the 18V ProCORE ecosystem so batteries swap across the fleet.</li></ul>',
