  'p_the_dewalt_dcg405_grinder_keeps_productivity_high_with_a_slim_grip_and_safety_brake_p_ul_li_125_mm_cutting_capacity_supported_by_a9000_rpm_brushless_motor_li_li_weighs2_2_kg_for_fatigue_free_overhead_work_li_li_part_of_the18v_xr_system_for_shared_batteries_and_chargers_li_ul' => '<p>The DeWalt DCG405 grinder keeps productivity high with a slim grip and safety brake.</p><ul><li>125 mm cutting capacity supported by a 9000 rpm brushless motor.</li><li>Weighs 2.2 kg for fatigue-free overhead work.</li><li>Part of the 18V XR system for shared batteries and chargers.</li></ul>',
