  'p_the_dewalt_dck425d2_kit_keeps_crews_productive_from_drilling_to_cutting_p_ul_li_drill_driver_impact_driver_worklight_radio_cover_daily_jobsite_tasks_li_li_supplied_with2x2_0ah_batteries_on_the18v_xr_system_li_li_delivered_in_toughsystem_tote_for_organised_transport_li_ul' => '<p>The DeWalt DCK425D2 kit keeps crews productive from drilling to cutting.</p><ul><li>Drill driver, impact driver, worklight, radio cover daily jobsite tasks.</li><li>Supplied with 2x2.0Ah batteries on the 18V XR system.</li><li>Delivered in ToughSystem tote for organised transport.</li></ul>',
