  'p_the_dewalt_dcs520_delivers_straight_cuts_with_guided_rails_and_clean_plunge_action_p_ul_li_165_mm_blade_paired_with54v_flexvolt_drive_for_smooth_cuts_li_li_accurate59_mm_depth_control_keeps_tear_out_low_li_li_balanced_design_at4_7_kg_for_all_day_framing_work_li_ul' => '<p>The DeWalt DCS520 delivers straight cuts with guided rails and clean plunge action.</p><ul><li>165 mm blade paired with 54V FlexVolt drive for smooth cuts.</li><li>Accurate 59 mm depth control keeps tear-out low.</li><li>Balanced design at 4.7 kg for all-day framing work.</li></ul>',
  'p_the_dewalt_dcs565_delivers_straight_cuts_with_guided_rails_and_clean_plunge_action_p_ul_li_165_mm_blade_paired_with18v_xr_drive_for_smooth_cuts_li_li_accurate55_mm_depth_control_keeps_tear_out_low_li_li_balanced_design_at3_2_kg_for_all_day_framing_work_li_ul' => '<p>The DeWalt DCS565 delivers straight cuts with guided rails and clean plunge action.</p><ul><li>165 mm blade paired with 18V XR drive for smooth cuts.</li><li>Accurate 55 mm depth control keeps tear-out low.</li><li>Balanced design at 3.2 kg for all-day framing work.</li></ul>',
